    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d636">

                <pb facs="0719" n="639" xml:id="pg639"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Powell.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-08-21"><hi rendition="#italic">August 21,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 533.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to Department’s No. 530, of
                    August 16 last, I inclose for your information copies of a letter from the
                    Department of Justice, and of this Department’s reply, in regard to the
                    preservation of the neutrality of the United States as regards Haiti.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>



